{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "name": "Stutter",
  "description": "Beat-repeat: on a trigger, or while `hold` is on, the slice of audio that starts at that moment repeats over and over in time with the beat, then the input comes back. Mono or stereo; the output has as many channels as the input.\n\n- `in`: the signal to stutter.\n- `division` (beats): the length of the repeated slice, at the project tempo; 0.25 is a sixteenth note, 0.5 an eighth, 1 a quarter note. Read when a stutter starts (up to 2 seconds).\n- `trigger`: starts a stutter that lasts `length`. A trigger during a stutter makes it last `length` from that trigger, on the same slice.\n- `length` (beats): how long a triggered stutter lasts, counting the first pass of the slice. With `length` 1 and `division` 0.25 you hear the slice four times.\n- `hold`: stutters for as long as it is on, as well.\n- `out`: the input, or the repeating slice.\n\nExactly: when a stutter starts (a trigger, or `hold` turning on), the slice's first pass is the input itself, playing live. One `division` later the Freeze takes that slice, the last `division` of audio, and loops it until the stutter ends (`length` after the last trigger and `hold` off), when the input fades back in over 5 ms. A stutter shorter than one `division` doesn't loop at all. Trigger on the beat (from a `Clock`) to keep the repeats on the grid.\n\nInside: Trigger to Gate (in beats) stretches `trigger` into a gate `length` long, and Logic ors it with `hold`. Its rising edge, delayed by one `division` (Trigger Delay, in beats), sets a Latch, and any edge of the gate resets it; Logic ands the Latch with the gate so a stutter that ends early never loops. That drives `hold` on a Freeze whose `size` is `division` converted to seconds at the current tempo.",
  "version": 1,
  "author": "Audio Constructor",
  "tags": [
    "rhythm",
    "glitch",
    "repeat",
    "loop",
    "effect"
  ],
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "in",
      "type": "audio",
      "targets": [
        "9:in"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "division",
      "type": "float",
      "unit": "beats",
      "default": 0.25,
      "range": [
        0.0625,
        2.0
      ],
      "targets": [
        "5:time",
        "8:in"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "trigger",
      "type": "trigger",
      "targets": [
        "1:in"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "length",
      "type": "float",
      "unit": "beats",
      "default": 1.0,
      "range": [
        0.25,
        4.0
      ],
      "targets": [
        "1:length"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hold",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "targets": [
        "2:a"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outputs": [
    {
      "name": "out",
      "type": "audio",
      "source": "9:out"
    }
  ],
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "1",
        "kind": "trigger_to_gate",
        "config": {
          "unit": "beats"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Stutter length"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "kind": "logic",
        "params": {
          "op": "or"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            240.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Hold or trigger"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "3",
        "kind": "gate_to_trigger",
        "params": {
          "edge": "both"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            480.0,
            300.0
          ],
          "label": "Any edge"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4",
        "kind": "gate_to_trigger",
        "params": {
          "edge": "rising"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            480.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Start"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "5",
        "kind": "trigger_delay",
        "config": {
          "unit": "beats"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            720.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "After one slice"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6",
        "kind": "latch",
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            960.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Looping"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "7",
        "kind": "logic",
        "params": {
          "op": "and"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1200.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Loop now"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "8",
        "kind": "convert",
        "params": {
          "op": "beats_to_seconds"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1200.0,
            360.0
          ],
          "label": "Slice (s)"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "9",
        "kind": "freeze",
        "params": {
          "position": 0.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1440.0,
            0.0
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "wires": [
      {
        "from": "1:gate",
        "to": "2:b"
      },
      {
        "from": "2:out",
        "to": "3:in"
      },
      {
        "from": "2:out",
        "to": "4:in"
      },
      {
        "from": "4:out",
        "to": "5:in"
      },
      {
        "from": "5:out",
        "to": "6:set"
      },
      {
        "from": "3:out",
        "to": "6:reset"
      },
      {
        "from": "6:out",
        "to": "7:a"
      },
      {
        "from": "2:out",
        "to": "7:b"
      },
      {
        "from": "7:out",
        "to": "9:hold"
      },
      {
        "from": "8:out",
        "to": "9:size"
      }
    ]
  }
}
